- page_title "#{@group.name} settings"
- content_for :heading, @group.name
- content_for :back_path, group_path(@group)

= render "groups/tabs", group: @group

- if @group.archived?
  .mb-4= render "groups/archived_banner", group: @group

= form_with model: @group, class: "space-y-5" do |form|
  .card.card-pad.space-y-4{ data: { reveal: true } }
    %h2.text-sm.font-semibold.text-ink-900 Details
    %div
      = form.label :name, "Group name", class: "label"
      = form.text_field :name, class: "input"
    %div
      = form.label :description, "What's it for?", class: "label"
      = form.text_area :description, rows: 2, class: "input", placeholder: "Optional"
    %div
      = form.label :base_currency_code, "Group currency", class: "label"
      = form.select :base_currency_code, currency_options, {}, class: "input"
      %p.mt-1.text-xs.text-ink-500
        Totals here are shown in this currency. Expenses keep whatever currency they were entered in,
        and any rate you have already locked stays locked.

  = form.submit "Save changes", class: "btn-primary w-full"

- unless @group.archived?
  .mt-8.card.card-pad{ data: { reveal: true } }
    %h2.font-semibold.text-ink-900 Archive this group
    %p.mt-1.text-sm.text-ink-600
      For a trip that's over. Nothing is deleted and you can reopen it whenever you like.
    %ul.mt-3.space-y-2.text-sm.text-ink-600
      %li.flex.gap-2
        %span.text-ink-400 ·
        %span It moves out of your groups list into Archived, and stays readable.
      %li.flex.gap-2
        %span.text-ink-400 ·
        %span Nobody can add expenses or record payments in it.
      %li.flex.gap-2
        %span.text-ink-400 ·
        %span Anything still unsettled here stops counting towards what you owe or are owed.
      %li.flex.gap-2
        %span.text-ink-400 ·
        %span Its spending still appears in your insights — it happened, after all.
      %li.flex.gap-2
        %span.text-ink-400 ·
        %span Everyone in the group is told.
    = button_to "Archive group", archive_group_path(@group), method: :patch,
                class: "btn-secondary mt-4 w-full",
                form: { data: { confirm: "Archive #{@group.name}?", confirm_detail: "It stops taking expenses and leaves your totals. Nothing is deleted, and you can reopen it from here.", confirm_label: "Archive", confirm_tone: "primary" } }

- if @group.expenses.none? && @group.settlements.none?
  .mt-6.card.card-pad{ data: { reveal: true } }
    %h2.font-semibold.text-ink-900 Delete this group
    %p.mt-1.text-sm.text-ink-500
      It has nothing in it, so there is nothing to keep.
    = button_to "Delete group", group_path(@group), method: :delete, class: "btn-danger mt-3 w-full",
                form: { data: { confirm: "Delete #{@group.name}?", confirm_detail: "This one is empty, so it can go for good.", confirm_label: "Delete" } }
